{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id434032710"}, "name":{"label":"Keric B."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-31T23:57:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.8"}, "id":{"label":"11330120722"}, "title":{"label":"love businesses that walk the walk"}, "content":{"label":"Update is a game-changer! The interface is so clean and user-friendly. But you know what I really love? How they updated the logo with the rainbow pride flag for this month. Such a cool move showing their support for the LGBTQ+ community. It's refreshing to see a big name bank getting behind inclusivity like that. I love businesses that walk the walk when it comes to progressive values. Simple gestures like a rainbow logo go a long way in making folks feel seen and celebrated. Mad respect to SC for doing their part.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"12"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"24"}}, 
