{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id265725704"}, "name":{"label":"Feidengold"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-12T19:19:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"11261481681"}, "title":{"label":"Worst UI and outdated information"}, "content":{"label":"Transaction details are never up to date (takes 10 days to see some transactions) making monthly statements reflect more recent transactions that are still not in the app.\n\nLive agent option on the app is constantly marked as reconnecting sending 30-50 messages of reconnection into the chat while the chat is apparently still connected fine based on conversation being continued with the agent. But as soon as you leave the chat to check something the agent asked for in the app you can’t return back to the same dialogue but have to go through AI Stacy and start over with the new agent. \n\nRewards portal is the worst possible of all HK banks, it is hard to find and hard to use. Interest rate on savings accounts is not visible so it’s impossible to tell what are the rates.\n\nThis is the app made to keep you uninformed so you never withdraw your rewards and hopefully always overdue.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-19T01:29:53-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store：用户評論"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
